### VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client). Run schema.sql and seed.sql first, then start the API (F5).
@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Sign in as Admin QA and as the KAC (External AMO) user
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identity": "admin@aeroauth.local" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

# @name kacLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identity": "kac.user@aeroauth.local" }

###
@kacToken = {{kacLogin.response.body.token}}

### 2. Tenant scoping: KAC sees only KAC staff
GET {{host}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{kacToken}}

### 3. Admin QA sees every organization
GET {{host}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Staff with AML and scope in one query (multi-mapping)
GET {{host}}/api/staff/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Tenant check: KAC asks for a RAMCO staff member (id 2). Result: 404, not another organization's data
GET {{host}}/api/staff/2
Authorization: Bearer {{kacToken}}

### 6. KAC submits a new staff member (transaction: staff + AML + scope + review queue)
POST {{host}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{kacToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stationId": 1, "staffNumber": "K-1100", "fullName": "Test Engineer", "email": "test.engineer@kac.example",
  "aml": [ { "naaId": 2, "amlNumber": "GACA-70001", "issueDate": "2026-01-01", "expiryDate": "2029-01-01" } ],
  "scope": [ { "aircraftTypeId": 1, "scopeBasis": "AMLEndorsed", "amlIndex": 0, "category": "B1", "level": "Line", "location": "RUH", "effectiveFrom": "2026-10-30" } ] }

### 7. Admin QA review queue
GET {{host}}/api/review-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Approve a staff submission (use the staffId from the queue)
PUT {{host}}/api/staff/3/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "Approved", "comment": "Documents verified." }

### 9. KAC submits a training session (trainer 1 = Omar Haddad, attendee 1)
POST {{host}}/api/training-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{kacToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stationId": 1, "trainerStaffId": 1, "sessionDate": "2026-10-30", "venue": "RUH training room", "materialIds": [ 2 ], "attendeeStaffIds": [ 1 ] }

### 10. Approve the session: queue item, session, certificate records and counter in ONE transaction
POST {{host}}/api/training-sessions/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Approved." }

### 11. Approving it a second time is refused (409): the queue item is no longer Pending
POST {{host}}/api/training-sessions/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Again." }

### 12. Freeze and unfreeze (each writes the Admin Actions Log in the same transaction)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/1/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "freezeReasonId": 2, "notes": "Refresher overdue" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/staff/1/unfreeze
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notes": "Refresher completed" }
